}

docs {
  # List Lucky Draws

  **Method:** `GET`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/groups/:groupID/draws`
  **Auth:** Required

  ## Description

  Lists this group's non-deleted draws in descending created_at and ID order. Both DRAFT and COMPLETED draws are included unless status is supplied.

  Each item includes a result for completed draws and null for drafts. Candidates and total_weight are available through Get Lucky Draw. An inactive group remains readable and returns is_frozen=true. Empty results return items: []. A page beyond the final page can be empty while pagination.total is positive.

  All endpoints require an ACTIVE account and ACTIVE membership in this group. Text candidates are not people or memberships. There is no deletion endpoint.

  ## Request

  ### Headers

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | Bearer access token (`Bearer <token>`) |

  ### Path Parameters

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `groupID` | `integer` | Yes | Positive BIGINT group ID; variable `drawGroupId` |

  Path IDs must be from 1 to 9223372036854775807.

  ### Query Parameters

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `page` | `integer` | No | Starts at 1; default 1. |
  | `limit` | `integer` | No | From 1 to 100; default 20. |
  | `status` | `string` | No | Exactly DRAFT or COMPLETED. |

  No request body is required.

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`**

  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "items": [
        {
          "id": 701,
          "group_id": 10,
          "created_by_member_id": 30,
          "title": "Dinner choice",
          "status": "DRAFT",
          "is_frozen": false,
          "result": null,
          "completed_at": null,
          "created_at": "2026-11-11T10:00:00Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-11-11T10:00:00Z"
        }
      ],
      "pagination": {
        "page": 1,
        "limit": 20,
        "total": 1
      }
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  Errors use the standard Auth, Friendships and Polls envelope. Authentication and malformed HTTP input are validated before service rules. An inactive group is checked before loading a draw for a write, so DRAW_GROUP_INACTIVE can precede draw state or creator errors.

  | HTTP | code | error | When |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | 400 | `BAD_REQUEST` | bad request payload or parameters | Invalid JSON, field type, title, empty update, path ID, status filter or pagination. |
  | 401 | `MISSING_TOKEN` | authorization token is missing | A Bearer access token is required. |
  | 401 | `TOKEN_INVALID` | authorization token is invalid | The token is invalid or not an access token. |
  | 401 | `TOKEN_EXPIRED` | authorization token has expired | The access token expired. |
  | 401 | `TOKEN_REVOKED` | authorization token has been revoked | The access token is blacklisted. |
  | 403 | `USER_INACTIVE` | user account is deactivated | The caller account is inactive. |
  | 403 | `DRAW_FORBIDDEN` | only active group members can access this lucky draw | The caller is not an active member of this group, or has left it. |
  | 404 | `USER_NOT_FOUND` | user not found | The caller no longer exists or has been soft-deleted. |
  | 404 | `GROUP_NOT_FOUND` | group not found | The group does not exist or has been soft-deleted. |
  | 500 | `INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR` | an internal server error occurred | Persistence, transaction, random generation or authentication infrastructure failed; internal causes are not returned. |

  **Example: 403**

  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "code": "DRAW_FORBIDDEN",
    "error": "only active group members can access this lucky draw"
  }
  ```
}
